WEBVTT

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:05.480
It really does look like a witch's house!

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.420
Okay, we're going in.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.110
"Bar"?

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.740
Not quite what I expected...

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:19.870
An ordinary bar?

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.290
Make yourselves at home.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:27.790
You're my first guests in a while.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:30.250
<b>Witch 
Winnie</b>

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.260
Hey, is this...

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.090
Yes.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.390
The Witch of the Western Forest, Winnie.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.300
Humans,

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:38.980
harefolk,

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.360
and an ogre...

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.270
How did you know?

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.520
I've been watching you 
for a while now.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:47.610
You're a curious party indeed.

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:49.330
You, most of all...

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.940
Me? How come?

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.180
You don't realize it?

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.010
I have a favor to ask you!

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.170
Teach me magic!

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:34.250
Why did you save only Berett?

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:37.030
Ideals and Reality

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.090
No particular reason.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.960
As I was rummaging 
through the castle library,

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:43.640
I felt a great swell of power, 
so I teleported out.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.640
That boy...

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:46.770
just happened to be nearby.

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:49.640
He was in the right place 
to be saved.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.710
Had I more time, 
I might have been able to save more.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:55.940
Winnie the Witch.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.030
You saved my soldier.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:01.910
Thank you.

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.160
You're welcome.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:06.390
Winnie.

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:10.240
What kind of magic do witches use?

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:11.310
A general selection.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:14.880
Attack spells, transportation spells, 
and many others.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.720
Let me ask you again.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.510
Please teach me magic!

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.520
Where's this coming from 
all of a sudden?

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:22.380
It's not sudden at all!

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:25.750
Ever since I heard about the witch, 
I've been thinking...

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.970
I can't use a sword,

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.810
and I'm not strong like Frau.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.580
Sally beat that ogre!

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:32.440
Sally's strong!

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.280
That walrus one?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.940
But I don't actually remember doing it.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:41.150
I need a power of my own, like magic.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.070
It's the only way 
I can continue my journey.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.080
I've witnessed your humanity 
in my crystal ball.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.200
You're someone I wouldn't mind teaching.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.510
Really?!

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.580
But I have three conditions.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:56.430
One: Do not speak of this anywhere.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:59.090
Two: Obey me unquestioningly.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.230
Three: A million.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.340
"A million"?

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.350
My payment.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.340
That's a lot!

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:09.070
Anyone can use magic
 with the right teacher.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.730
That makes it easy to abuse.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.910
I do believe I can trust you,

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.410
but I can't do it lightly,

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:17.480
or for free.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.430
You know I don't have it.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:22.270
Given your circumstances,

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.070
I'll accept all the money 
you currently have.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.780
Hawthorn, princess's orders!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:28.990
Hang on! Calm down!

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.820
Which is more important? 
Money or me?!

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:32.310
Money!

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:33.440
Meanie!

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:35.210
And speaking realistically...

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:38.960
How are we supposed to keep
 traveling if we use all this up?

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:43.510
But... I'm so helpless right now.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.120
So...

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.830
Hawthorn, teach me swordsmanship!

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:52.640
Now that I think about it,

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:55.020
are you even any good at this?

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:58.070
The captain was the best 
swordsman in the kingdom!

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.340
Really?

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.780
Don't worry about stance 
or form right now.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.000
Just come at me with all you've got.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:04.890
Sure!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.920
You're a woman, and you're making it 
a contest of strength against me?

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.420
Try looking at her 
through that eye of yours.

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:29.300
You'll see something very interesting.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:32.660
<i>If I look at a person with my </i>xian dao,<i></i>

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.680
<i>I can see their latent magic power.</i>

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.940
<i>Hawthorn's is about average.</i>

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:47.200
<i>Sally...</i>

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.200
<i>What in the world...</i>

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.100
<i>are you?</i>

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.300
It's gotten pretty late, huh?

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:57.260
What's the plan?

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.330
Passing through the forest 
at night could be risky.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:04.340
I have several spare rooms, 
dusty from lack of use.

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:07.450
If you clean them up, 
you can use them for free.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.100
Really?

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:09.910
Hey, I'm great at cleaning!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.300
Thank you, Winnie.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:14.920
A moment, Captain.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.790
There's something I'd like you to see.

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:20.700
Look closely.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.580
Witness what happened that day,

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:27.360
and just how much power she possesses.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.140
I thought you'd come.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:42.380
Frau.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:43.920
It's been a while.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.510
Three years now, I believe?

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:48.150
Winnie...

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.010
Much has happened since then.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.520
Monsters running rampant in the world.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.510
War between humans and demihumans.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.930
And you cast aside your power,

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:00.220
and feign ignorance of it all 
in the guise of a harefolk.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:04.000
I'm not judging you for it.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.230
I'm simply stating the truth.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:09.280
For you.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:11.230
I expect you'll need it.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.300
I saw you using a mallet 
as a weapon earlier.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.020
Thanks!

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.020
It's nothing.

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.450
We're old friends, after all.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:24.170
One more favor, for an old friend.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:27.170
Teach Sally magic, please.

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.870
You care a great deal for her, 
don't you?

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.930
One million...

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.910
I'll let you pay me later.

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.830
A show of my respect.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.050
Winnie!

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:44.150
But remember, I haven't given in.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.960
Thanks, Winnie.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:48.940
Goodbye.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.190
Wait a minute.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.950
After all this time apart, 
you want to leave so quickly?

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:55.780
Sit down.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.080
I'll make you a carrot juice.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.580
Really?!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:05.090
You'll really teach me magic?

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.610
But you owe me a million.

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:07.460
You can pay later.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:08.610
What first?

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.710
Do I learn chants? 
Or meditation?

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:15.260
Frau, give Sally training 
to enhance her stamina.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.350
How come? What about the magic?

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:21.230
Magic is typically wielded 
only within a witch's family line.

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:25.350
Its use will be a massive drain 
on an ordinary human's stamina.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.450
So we need to build that up first.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.660
Condition two: Obey me unquestioningly.

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.490
I get it, okay?

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.570
Frau, how do we start?

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:36.540
Running!

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:37.620
Okay!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:46.380
<i>As a witch, she should be aware of the
 immense magic power that Sally holds.</i>

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.380
<i>She knows, but she says nothing.</i>

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.380
<i>What's her game, exactly?</i>

00:08:57.820 --> 00:08:59.190
I'm exhausted!

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:01.800
I give up. I'm dead.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.120
Time for sword training.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:07.290
Hang on a minute!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.150
I only just got back!

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:12.210
Condition two: Obey me unquestioningly.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.720
Fine!

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:19.500
I won't raise a hand against you, 
so don't worry.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:22.660
We'll stop whenever you land a hit.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.070
Got it!

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.920
<i>Her form is completely amateurish.</i>

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:30.920
<i>She has no muscle strength.</i>

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:32.420
<i>And yet...</i>

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.420
<i>She's aggressive.</i>

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:39.550
<i>I can't afford to take my eyes 
off her for a minute.</i>

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:43.810
<i>Pin the enemy down and finish them off...</i>

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.030
<i>Is that her talent?</i>

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:47.310
<i>Or...</i>

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.920
<i>Are you actually...</i>

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.690
Hey... Hawthorn?

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.920
Is this for real?

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:05.810
Yes.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:07.830
This is what happened at the castle.

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.440
What in the world...

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.270
How is she so powerful?

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:12.590
I don't know.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:17.590
But I know what to call someone 
with this much power.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:21.220
A devil.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.210
Don't say that!

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:23.850
She's a good girl!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.350
But only you and I know.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:29.280
People don't try to learn more about devils.

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:30.850
They just fear them.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:34.640
They keep their distance from witches 
for the same reason.

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:37.320
I want you to tell me.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.740
Having seen that, would you call Sally a devil?

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.100
Or...

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:48.750
What?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.160
When did I fall asleep?

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.250
You lost, Sally.

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:57.260
I did not!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.380
You said you wouldn't raise
 a hand against me!

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:00.630
Hawthorn?

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:12.450
I didn't raise a hand. 
I raised a foot!

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:13.400
Same thing!

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:14.610
Oh, please.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.720
Leg sweeps are part of sword-fighting.

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.320
You didn't teach me about that!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:19.780
Either way.

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:21.780
Get up, Sally.

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:30.040
<i>Maruya...</i>

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.920
<i>You've raised a kind grandson.
 He's just like you.</i>

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.920
<i>Protect her, Hawthorn.</i>

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:41.950
<i>The way your grandfather did me.</i>

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.490
Winnie.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.930
Lady Winnie!

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:52.780
It's been some time!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.280
A monster?

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.280
And that person's ears...

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.640
An elf and a lizardfolk.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.580
Unusual pairing.

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:09.560
Typically the species are 
at each other's throats.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.530
Shut up, stranger!

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:13.580
It's none of your business!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.590
What do the leaders of the elves 
and the lizardfolk want with me?

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:21.320
We wish you to remove the barrier 
in the southeast forest.

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:25.730
Yeah! We wanna murder 
that sealed-off ogre!

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:34.100
A sealed-off... ogre?

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:39.650
What led you to want to kill that ogre now?

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.450
It was anything but a hasty decision.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:43.380
Yeah.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:46.030
We've been gettin' ready 
to fight it for years now.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.990
It has not rained for several days.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.040
The forest is dry, and the winds are calm.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:55.830
It's our best chance to bring fire 
and burn that ogre to the—

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.670
Help us, witch!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.270
On one condition.

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:14.560
Why do we have to be a part of this?!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:19.940
It was Winnie's condition for helping them.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:25.180
Hey, Winnie.

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:26.370
Is there some reason we—

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:26.990
Hey.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.100
She's working.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.730
Don't bother her.

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:31.870
Working?

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.610
Extinguishing that smoke-like stuff?

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:35.250
Yeah.

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.030
That's the seal.

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:40.740
It keeps us from getting close to the ogre 
that sleeps deep in the forest.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:43.270
If it's asleep, why not leave it be?

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.510
A nearby kingdom was destroyed 
by an ogre the other day.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.260
It happened overnight.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:53.890
We can't leave anything that dangerous at large.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.770
We've got kids and elders in our village.

00:13:57.050 --> 00:14:00.900
As their leader, it's my job 
to set their minds at ease.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.950
Hey, you're a pretty nice guy!

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:05.900
Well, you look and act like total bad news.

00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:08.150
I just assumed you were a jerk.

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:08.970
Sorry!

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:10.160
Oh, shut up!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:13.610
Sally really doesn't see species, does she?

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:15.380
That's who Sally is.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:18.080
That's why Frau and Carrot both like Sally.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.940
I... suppose.

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.800
Hey.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:28.320
It seems to me there are more
 lizardfolk than elves here.

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.930
Elves use bows and arrows.

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:37.680
I've positioned them as the rear guard, 
in case the ogre tries to flee.

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:40.080
In a forest setting, with poor visibility,

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:42.060
most would keep the bowmen 
on the front lines.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.220
What would an amateur know about it?

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:46.910
Actually, allow me to introduce myself.

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:50.270
My name is Hawthorn Grattor,

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:53.700
regimental commander 
of the royal knights of Rimdarl.

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.330
A survivor of that lost kingdom?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:59.200
I see. So you're a professional...

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:04.340
I think you won't send the elves in 
until all the lizardfolk are dead.

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.550
H-Hey, Hawthorn!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.870
This is what I loathe about humans.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:12.340
U-Understandable!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:13.850
Sorry, Mr. Chief!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:14.810
Hawthorn is just—

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.990
You're completely right!

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:20.070
I plan to abandon the lizardfolk.

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:20.980
Why?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.660
Aren't they on your side?

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.110
They are not.

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.900
Our species are mortal enemies.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.650
But if you do that, after it's over...

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.040
They'll resent me?

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:31.710
And what if they do?

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:36.060
Let them resent me and kill me if they like.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.750
It is a small price to pay for all elfkind.

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:41.550
Remember this, human girl...

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:46.020
The hostility between races 
runs far deeper than you imagine.

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:49.380
Wow!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.630
Look at all these demihumans!

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.640
Are we havin' a party?

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:59.140
Wonder if it's okay for me 
to kill you all!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.510
Who's that?

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:02.390
She walked right out of the seal.

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:03.890
Is she human?

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:06.400
I know you...

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.780
Hatsuki!

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:11.000
No way! It's Meki!

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:13.650
Huh?

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:16.910
Meki, why're you hanging with humans?

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:18.410
Well...

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.430
Is this a friend of yours, Carrot?

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:21.910
Is she an ogre, too?

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.160
Y-Yes...

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:24.860
"Carrot"?

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.460
Not Meki?

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:31.170
Carrot's a pretty cute name, though!

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:35.020
Now you've got me wondering...

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:37.180
Have you turned against the ogres?!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:39.080
W-Well... I...

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.350
She hasn't.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.530
Carrot lost her ogre power,

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:45.360
so I've been dragging her around with us.

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.580
If you want to blame someone, blame me!

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:48.710
Sally...

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.840
Lost her ogre power?

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.870
Oh, I see...

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.700
You poor little dear!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.760
That human beat you, 
snapped off your horn,

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:01.200
and now she's dragging you 
around with her?

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.960
Actually, the horn wasn't my—

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:04.880
You'll be okay!

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:07.410
I'll save you right now 
and make it all better!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.330
H-Hang on!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:11.840
Because I'll end your living torment!

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:15.690
Master Sumeragi is such a tease.

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:17.930
I'll bet that's why he sent me here.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:21.850
Waking <i>him</i> was just a bonus...

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:25.600
It's clear that you're the main dish.

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.600
Just you wait, Meki!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.900
I'll get to killing you in no time!

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:36.680
Wh-What's that?!

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:38.030
That's Hatsuki.

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.490
An ogre who controls hair!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.580
Is that the sealed ogre?

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.040
No, it's not.

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:48.170
I haven't removed the seal yet, for one thing.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:51.070
The sealed ogre shouldn't even be conscious.

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:52.920
It couldn't possibly be moving.

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:54.170
<i>Unless...</i>

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:56.660
An earthquake?

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:57.550
Not good!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.600
Wh-What's going on?

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.340
Are those... tree roots?

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.240
<b>High Ogre Juki 
(Tree Ogre)</b>

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.120
It's huge!

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:25.510
Impossible...

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:29.270
The sealed ogre 
couldn't have been that large!

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:31.920
Ogre of hair!

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.000
What have you done?

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.630
Not tellin'!

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.410
We should retreat at once!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:39.400
Don't be stupid!

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.390
We can't leave that thing at large!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:43.820
I'll buy time!

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:45.390
Get as far away as you can!

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:47.710
Do you want to get yourself killed?

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.020
You can't do that!

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:50.940
What do I do?

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:56.300
Is this more of your plotting?

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:57.900
You wound me.

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.530
I'm just doing the best I can.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:02.840
Trying to take that human's measure?

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.900
Something like that, I suppose.

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:07.180
I could have finished it 
if you'd sent me.

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:08.960
Why bother with all this?

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:12.090
You don't take orders from me.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.170
A woman?

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.920
A lone traveler?

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.000
That's not good.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:19.970
Careless thing.

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.930
I was just feeling hungry anyway.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:24.040
Yes, I suppose you were.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.480
Poor thing.

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:27.430
I should dig her a grave, at least—

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:31.560
I'm so sorry.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.560
He approached so carelessly

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:38.570
that I couldn't help 
but finish him with a strike.

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:41.030
He appears to have been a high ogre.

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:45.830
Should I have made it feel 
 more like a struggle?

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:49.000
Well... No need to trouble yourself, 
I'm sure.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.550
Might I ask your name, then?

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:53.080
Kibitsu Mikoto.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:57.340
The enemy of ogres like you.

00:19:58.110 --> 00:19:59.270
I see...

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:01.590
So you're that monster-hunter!

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:04.510
But I must say, Hatsuki...

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:08.800
It's hard for me to move 
when I'm this large.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.980
C'mon, old man! Get over it!

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:12.990
Winnie.

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:17.280
Is it safe to assume that your magic
 is a match for that ogre?

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.700
Yes.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:19.360
But...

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:24.680
I suppose it's a fair size 
for killing the lizards and the long-ears.

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:24.360
Burning something that size 
will require substantial preparation.

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:26.610
You can have them all.

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:29.240
But those humans are mine. 
You hear me?

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.240
Listen, everyone!

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:30.980
We're going to slay that ogre.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:34.250
So do just as I say.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.050
Though I must say,

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:40.260
I'd sure like to kill that witch 
who sealed me.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:44.460
The lizardfolk and elves will draw 
the tree ogre's attention.

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:48.260
Meanwhile, Winnie will enter
 the forest and prepare her spell.

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:52.140
With its eyeline that high up, 
the entire forest is a blind spot.

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:53.250
Sounds like whoever gets 
done first kills the witch.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:55.270
You should be safe 
while the others are drawing attention.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.000
Now, as for that hair ogre...

00:20:56.340 --> 00:21:00.020
Hey! What are you guys doin'?

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:00.020
She seems to really have it in for Sally.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.930
We'll use Sally as bait,

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:03.030
and Frau and I will finish her.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.030
Understood!

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:07.880
Sure hope it'll be that easy.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:09.850
Change of plans.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.860
Tell the others we're fighting 
<i>with</i> the lizardfolk!

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:13.540
Sir!

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:15.990
Are you kiddin' me?

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:19.290
It's the best way to protect 
the forest and the elves.

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:21.780
You can understand that, can't you?

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:27.300
Lizardfolk and elves fighting 
under a human's command...

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:28.530
If you insist!

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.600
Let's go, you rabble!

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:32.810
Disperse!

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.180
I waited for you guys,

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:37.840
so you'd better show me a fun time!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:41.690
Look at this!

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:45.410
Different species banding 
together to slay an ogre...

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:49.200
I'm sure it's a heartwarming sight, 
for a human.

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:53.760
Of course, since I'm no longer an ogre,

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:55.580
it doesn't matter to me either way.

00:21:57.820 --> 00:22:00.110
I've decided on a purpose for my journey!

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:02.710
I want to create at least a little compromise!

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:04.880
Listen, everyone!

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:06.510
Elves, lizardfolk,

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:07.550
tree ogre,

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:08.920
and Hairy there...

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:10.140
"Hairy"?

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:12.390
Everyone here...

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:14.020
We're going to make peace!

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:50.250
Resolutions and Goodbyes

00:23:46.450 --> 00:23:49.110
Next time: "Resolutions and Goodbyes."
